## Coverage map

| Promise | Preserved mechanism |
|---|---|
| harness-kits §5.3 adapter and seat-wiring acceptance | All8 adapter tests, both wiring tests and sanitized hook sink/PTY pair remain. |
| #279 actual exec preserves PTY process identity | Ready listener → real exec → emitted PID equals owned child PID; real process boundary retained. |
| #279 delayed/missing native runtime | Virtual clock verifies readiness transition and unchanged5s error budget, with typed InvalidData. |
| #279 read-only, no guessed thread, no write to another process | Codex bootstrap/loaded-thread transcript, binding fences, kernel-peer mismatch with zero bytes. |
| #279 owned aliases and native socket registration | All4 alias tests and3 registration/pre-write cases retained. |
| Honest specific failure today | Public-note regressions kept by ruling44845a1d; no API change. Follow-up: typed WakeOutcome cause port (Oracle opens task). |
| Nonblocking fixture release when child dies | Existing first-launch test adds owned child kill/reap before ordinary release write. Red FIFO candidate fails the safety predicate; regular-file notification candidate passes. |

Before: 25 passed/3 paired ignored, reported test-run 5.92s. After: 26 passed/3 paired ignored, 1.42s. These are coarse framework times under uncontrolled load, not a speed gate. The real5s test wait is gone. Sleep calls in test fixtures:3→0.

The only production edit is private wait_for_runtime ready/elapsed/pause callbacks used by exec_when_ready; its socket selection, check order,5s budget,5ms pause, exec and public result/API are unchanged. No manifest, protocol or app edit. Read/response timeouts are30s hang guards. The hook sink observes a supplied deadline budget, not a latency bound.

No peer kit path overlap. Rook identified the FIFO writer counterexample before acceptance; FIFO was discarded. Regular-file notifications use vnode events on macOS/BSD and inotify on Linux. The Linux fixture branch is not runtime-tested on this macOS host.

Verification: crate tests0, strict all-target clippy0, adjacent bbt-mux first-launch shared-fixture test0. The intentional FIFO red exited101; all raw results retained. Final combined presubmit/postsubmit covers the four-crate stack per ruling44845a1d.
